            "The source separately lists Chinese Language and Literature plus International Politics and plus Business Administration dual-degree programmes. Those are unapproved separate combinations, not imported as this single-subject bachelor or new directions. Ordinary and cooperation funding arrangements stay within one selected subject; no scholarship track, annual intake or term option becomes a separate programme identity. The2027spring language deadline does not apply to the bachelor row.",
